{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1521620001:0":{"text":"Are you Warner?","source_cn":"你是维尔纳？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE4E2CFFF6EF7D5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521620002:0":{"text":"Yes, do we know each other?","source_cn":"你们是谁？找我有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B94202889134ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521620003:0":{"text":"We found your father's letter and his carving knife.","source_cn":"我们找到了你阿爹的信。唔，还有刻刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BEC850A5F611864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521620004:0":{"text":"His carving knife?\nNo way! My old man would never hand his knife to anyone!","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521620004":{"text":"His carving knife?\nNo way! My old man would never hand his knife to anyone!","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521620005:0":{"text":"Tuttleton has been destroyed... No, this can't be...","source_cn":"图塔镇毁灭了……这、这不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A36F580F2F5E92E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521620006:0":{"text":"And my mother and father... They...","source_cn":"还有我老爹和老娘……他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4AE0C8B5942610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521620007:0":{"text":"You'll understand after you read the letter.","source_cn":"你看了信以后，就会明白的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA061CE06608686F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521620008:0":{"text":"Warner's hands tremble as he takes the letter. A long silence passes... then his eyes well up with tears.","source_cn":"维尔纳颤抖地接过信。好半晌的沉默之后，他的眼里已盛满泪水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF549B48EA2E7114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521620009:0":{"text":"My father... Where is he? I need to find him...","source_cn":"我老爹……他，他在哪？我必须去找他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770AA99817A5ED1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521620010:0":{"text":"He's been turned into a monster. He isn't the man you knew.","source_cn":"他已经畸变成怪物，不是你认识的那个人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4895B6397DB20F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521620011:0":{"text":"No matter what he's become, he's still my father. Please take me to him.","source_cn":"不管他变成什么样，他都是我老爹！求求你们，带我去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x598CE5871F24D33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521620012:0":{"text":"I haven't been back in years... He always wrote letters telling me to visit, but I was always busy...","source_cn":"我已经好几年没有回去了……他总是写信，但我总是忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0634147F09B20C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521620013:0":{"text":"I need to see him...!","source_cn":"我……我不能连他最后一面也不见……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDC0367D16F292CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521620014:0":{"text":"Tuttleton is too dangerous for you right now.","source_cn":"但是，图塔镇的黑暗对你来说太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CDA4F194F8BF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1521620014":{"text":"Tuttleton is too dangerous for you right now.","source_cn":"但是，图塔镇的黑暗对你来说太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CDA4F194F8BF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521620015:0":{"text":"Yes! I'll do anything if you can take me to him...","source_cn":"不管什么方法，只要能带我去见他就行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E30A1C33B11CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521620016:0":{"text":"Please, I'm begging you.","source_cn":"拜托……求求你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF121C043A477F52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521620017:0":{"text":"Warner pleads with you, so you cast a protective spell over him.","source_cn":"在维尔纳的恳求下，你为他施加了一个保护魔法。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF90719477A9AE57","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Warner pleads with you, so you cast a protective spell over him.","female":"Warner pleads with you, so you cast a protective spell over him.","variant_male_record_index":"183105","variant_female_record_index":"183106","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521620018:0":